<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak VSZ a.s. says to take $50 mln, 5yr synd loan.</title>
<headline>Slovak VSZ a.s. says to take $50 mln, 5yr synd loan.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's largest steel producer, VSZ a.s., on Monday said it would sign a five-year, $50 million revolving credit, lead managed by Chase Manhattan, by the end of this month.</p>
<p>Jozef Burian, head of VSZ financial department, told Reuters the company was also considering an international bond issue at the end of this year or in the beginning of 1998. He did not elaborate on this.</p>
</text>
